<title>USA: U.S. stocks seen up after ECI data.</title>
<headline>U.S. stocks seen up after ECI data.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. stocks were seen opening higher on Tuesday after a report on the first quarter Employment Cost Index, a key gauge of wage inflation.</p>
<p>Orders for costly manufactured goods were broadly lower in March, the Commerce Department said, dropping at the sharpest rate in seven months.</p>
